  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DDP 2024 ELECTIONS CAPACITY BUILDING INTERVENTION FOR JOURNALIST PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DDP 2024 Elections Capacity Building Intervention for Journalist Project in South Africa, implemented by The Democracy Development Program aims to contribute to enhance media practioners&apos; capabilities of deepening democracy through accurate electoral reporting. The objectives of the grant are to equip journalists with knowledge and skills for covering an election in a sensitive manner that promotes factual reporting in a politically competitive environment and to enhance the understanding of the delegates of the role journalists play in ensuring peaceful elections and promoting democracy through the dissemination of information to the citizenry. The key activities include: a training workshop and fieldwork.</narrative>
  </description>
